name:  Camp Grounds
theme: camp
notes: ~52x52. South EDGE is a solid wall (the summoning room's front); player walks out the doorway into a CAMP (commons + fire pit, dirt ring road, tents); street north to a WIDE sparring arena (3 raid lanes on the north wall); deep forest on top. TWO grids: terrain then '---' then a SPAWN OVERLAY (spawns layer on terrain).
